    "sections": {
        "description": "Portfolio Expert Lite is a sleek and lightweight WordPress portfolio theme. The theme designed specifically for creative professionals, designers, photographers, and freelancers who want to showcase their work with style and simplicity. Built with clean code and modern design principles, Portfolio Expert Lite inherits all the core functionalities of the parent theme while offering a minimal, fast-loading experience. It seamlessly integrates with popular page builders like Elementor and is fully responsive, SEO-friendly, and translation-ready. Ideal for those who need a professional online portfolio with ease of customization and reliability."
    },
